{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0c09aa9dc5a833d8eb9","chatId":"e1f63730c0d24d29b9f8552ea9069e7d","sessionId":null,"userId":98322,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":6470,"promptTokens":1639,"completionTokens":345,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:28"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":4,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068634970635499,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0c09aa9dc5a833d8eb8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482368114,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0c09aa9dc5a833d8eb8","chatId":"e1f63730c0d24d29b9f8552ea9069e7d","sessionId":null,"userId":98322,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小莫和小钱结婚四年了。今天小莫去杂货店时，小钱的妹妹小艾前来访问小钱。小莫回来时，她从客厅的窗户看到小艾和小钱坐着笑着聊天。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小莫最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊讶\nB) 失望\nC) 激动\nD) 紧张\nE) 嫉妒\nF) 没意识的\n\n## 问题 2\n小莫为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她看到丈夫和妹妹聊得很开心\nB) 她认为小钱在欺骗她\nC) 她不知道那个女人是谁\nD) 他们正在庆祝他们的四周年纪念日","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068634970635499,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0c09aa9dc5a833d8eb9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482368111,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9b11dee4ff6a4c1caf3c3a99471fb76d"}